\subsection{Purpose}
Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. This report justifies
the structure of a \emph{fictitious} footbridge: a steel beam simply supported
on two abutments. Every datum in this document is made up and serves only to
show how a calculation report is organised in Pyx.

